      "content": "hey i have type 1 and i feel really bad right now. im super shaky and sweating like crazy and my head feels all fuzzy/confused. my sugar was like 250 an hour ago so i think it's still way too high... should i just take an extra unit of rapid insulin now to bring it down?",
